* HS-200 parts library (PSpice macro models). Illustrative values for this practice mail.
.SUBCKT HSOPA IN+ IN- OUT VCC VEE
RIN IN+ IN- 10MEG
GM 0 X1 VALUE = { LIMIT(1m*V(IN+,IN-), -10u, 10u) }
RO1 X1 0 100MEG
CC X1 0 15.9p
E1 INT 0 VALUE = { LIMIT(V(X1), V(VEE,0)+0.1, V(VCC,0)-0.1) }
ROUT INT OUT 50
.ENDS HSOPA
* a part this board does not use: the simulator must not trip on it
.SUBCKT HSREF 1 2
E1 1 2 LAPLACE {V(1)} = {1/(1+0.001*s)}
.ENDS HSREF
